      "version": {
        "major": 1,
        "minor": 0
      },
      "notes": "The host services for the new instance are this connection's host/* methods, scoped by params.instanceId: every host/* call for this instance names it by that id. The result's instanceId is the driver's id for the instance, which may differ; instance/* calls name it by that one. params.paths carries HostServices.paths; params.hostMembers lists the optional host services the host serves for this instance."
    },
